{# SKILL.md scaffold for a `type: flow` skill (prose steps, no loom).

   Variables:
     name, description — frontmatter (description carries triggers)
     title             — H1
     intro             — 1-3 sentences
     prefix            — shell prefix, e.g. "LJ"
     skill_name        — kebab name for tiling labels
     target            — tiling label placeholder, e.g. "<name>"
     dependencies      — markdown bullets
     parameters        — markdown bullets
     aliases           — bash lines (`<PREFIX>_<SCRIPT>=...`), one per script
     invariants        — numbered list of rules that hold across adaptations
     steps             — list of {name, goal, substeps}; substeps is a
                         markdown numbered list (≤ 5 items)
     rules             — numbered list (may be empty)
     completion        — table body rows, one per status
#}
